{"id":"089bf65b649ac4fb","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching.md","title":"ZFC Graph Perfect Matching","display":"df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching — ZFC Graph Perfect Matching","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching — ZFC Graph Perfect Matching","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-graph-matching]]","[[58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching — ZFC Graph Perfect Matching"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c5d986e5d5d9635\" href=\"?note=3c5d986e5d5d9635\" title=\"58-df-zfc-graph-matching\">58-df-zfc-graph-matching</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"008d3c43acd3c172\" href=\"?note=008d3c43acd3c172\" title=\"58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph\">58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,G,V_G,E_G\\in V\">\\(M,G,V_G,E_G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"008d3c43acd3c172\" href=\"?note=008d3c43acd3c172\" title=\"58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph\">58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c5d986e5d5d9635\" href=\"?note=3c5d986e5d5d9635\" title=\"58-df-zfc-graph-matching\">58-df-zfc-graph-matching</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPerfectMatching}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPerfectMatching}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}matching}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPerfectMatching}_S(M,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V_G,E_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S(G,V_G,E_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S(M,G)\\land\n\\forall v\\in V_G\\;\\exists!e\\in M\\;(v\\in e)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}matching}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPerfectMatching}_S(M,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V_G,E_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S(G,V_G,E_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S(M,G)\\land\n\\forall v\\in V_G\\;\\exists!e\\in M\\;(v\\in e)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Perfectness uses the repository's set-coded simple-graph and matching predicates; every vertex is incident with exactly one matching edge.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-graph-matching","status":"resolved","id":"3c5d986e5d5d9635","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-graph-matching]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph","status":"resolved","id":"008d3c43acd3c172","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph","status":"resolved","id":"008d3c43acd3c172","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[58-df-zfc-graph-simple-graph]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-graph-matching","status":"resolved","id":"3c5d986e5d5d9635","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-zfc-graph-matching]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,G,V_G,E_G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPerfectMatching}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}matching}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphPerfectMatching}_S(M,G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists V_G,E_G\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphSimpleGraph}_S(G,V_G,E_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphMatching}_S(M,G)\\land\n\\forall v\\in V_G\\;\\exists!e\\in M\\;(v\\in e)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1099,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching.md|58-df-zfc-graph-perfect-matching]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["3c5d986e5d5d9635","008d3c43acd3c172"]}